WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:02.501
Two models, one set of prices.

2
00:00:03.202 --> 00:00:08.227
The dots are the prices. The dashed line takes off the same dollars every year.

3
00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:14.145
The solid curve takes off the same share each year.

4
00:00:14.973 --> 00:00:17.698
Only one of them goes through every dot.
